msgstr "校验码必须是 32、40、64 或 128 个十六进制字符（BLAKE2b 请加 b2:）。"

msgid "Choose another category or return to all downloads."
msgstr "选择其他分类，或返回全部下载。"

msgid "Chrome Web Store listing is not available yet. Install the bundled extension manually."
msgstr "目前尚未上架 Chrome 应用商店，请手动安装附带的扩展。"

msgid "Closing this window restores the main window."
msgstr "关闭精简窗口会还原主窗口，下载继续进行。"

